#. y4:msg_branch_choice=I kind of wish I was half Japanese myself.
msgctxt "2016_Rio"
msgid "Really? It would probably be pretty much the same."
msgstr "¿Ah sí? No creo que mucho siendo sincera."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
